Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for having called you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is from Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hospital charges,\Nas well as doctor's fees,\Nfood expenses while in the hospital, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All to be paid for by the\NEastern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snack food charges?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reading materials charges...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As well as a large bill\Nfrom a toy store...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have left on a trip\Nto further their objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe they will contact us before long,\Nso for the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you where they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are the Elric brothers here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, they aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where have they gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh, um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Nice going, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're finally here! Rush Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:31.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That ring is the new model from Studio Remis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought I'd be laying eyes on it in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buy it, buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Automail is the 1911 Gods' model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought the day would come when I'd be able to behold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice! I sure would like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A culverin cannon is\Nmade for men's ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl like you doesn't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what a shabby little store this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pops, let me have the\Nstrongest thing you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've come into some easy money, and I'm going to blow it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't ignore a customer, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine little piece, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stick it on me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only give my Automail to people who really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You what?! I'm a customer here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need something like this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with you,\Nyou nasty old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who needs your broken-down Automail, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hack mechanic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! It's what Rush Valley is famous for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Automail arm wrestling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entrance fee is 10,000 cens! Beat the champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you win all the money collected so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come and take it, you thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll step up to the plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, way to go, mister!\NYou're sure fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, did you see that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing they could do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little lady, are you sure you're okay with that substandard rig of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all,\Nshe's using that old fart's Automail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...\NFight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:54.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you like, I can introduce you\Nto an able craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, are there any challengers who want to go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The strong-looking gentleman there! How about going a round?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Well, how about the—\Nor so I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but calling out such a bean sprout of a boy wouldn't be right of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me a bean sprout!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, he's got a lot of energy for a bean sprout, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although, his Automail is awfully shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let Ed go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:34.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Don't you dare lose to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...\NFight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scrap collectors are going to be really busy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neener neener!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:17.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,510,000 cens!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this much, I can buy \Nall of those parts that I wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...\N{\i1}what I'm really happy about is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the guys who were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really did a number\Non us back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to get hurt,\Nhand over that money quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!\NWe beat you fair and square for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That bean sprout obviously cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?!\NYou used alchemy, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used it too, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, did you use alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you knew about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt! What are you doing, Win—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:34.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've brought Major Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there are those whom we suspect were\Nthe ones who killed the Brigadier General.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:01.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, why haven't\Nyou arrested them at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are suspected,\Nbut we don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a colonel,\NI am instructing you to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said those whom we suspect\Nwere the {\i1}ones{\i0} who killed Hughes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which means there was more than one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he wouldn't answer me,\Neven when I ordered him to as a colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it means that someone with a rank higher than mine\Nhas forbidden the Major\Nto talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, like Lieutenant Ross said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,since the Elric brothers are taking independent action\Nwithout reporting to me first,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.91,0:10:53.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we have to consider that the military is involved with the Philosopher's Stone somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(1860,4230,\c&H000000&,\3c&H000000&,\4c&H000000&)}As it is, we're in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry's nowhere to be found, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was a bad idea to use alchemy when you were arm wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys were cheating, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw you at the \Narm wrestling competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are your legs Automail, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an artificial-limb outfitter myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hurt your arm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible. The working is\Nsimple yet high-performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wasted in this design.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a load on\Nyour suspension here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've bent a cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tell that quickly\Njust by looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever made this\Nhas incredible skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should have them\Ntake a look at this right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, how did you\Ncome to have Automail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was in a train accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he's the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He took me in and even gave me\Nan arm and a pair of legs. Dominic-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, shouldn't you have him\Nfix you up all the more?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to tell him that\NI lost the arm wrestling contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to prove that \Nhis Automail was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, all you need to do is show that your Automail is amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could show that your Automail is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by beating a State Alchemist who also has Automail, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might be right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Paninya, what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dominic-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry to intrude. I'm Winry Rockbell, \Nan Automail mechanic from Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rockbell from Resembool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me you're Pinako's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The leopardess of Resembool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about her horrifies me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you an acquaintance \Nof my grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, where is that Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she slept outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dumb jerk, that's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I flew off\Nthe handle yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were there when\Nwe were arm wrestling...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her name's Paninya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I stayed over at\Nher house last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I take a look at\Nyour silver watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this about,\Nall of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a contest, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can get your silver watch back before Paninya takes it to the pawn shop, you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak, come on up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.81,0:16:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't give chase quickly, you can kiss your watch good-bye, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, why would you\Ndo such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want Ed to say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.49,0:16:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that her Automail is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hanging in there pretty well, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about you use that\Ntrademark alchemy of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop jerking me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, how about \Nreturning my silver watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this! My 1.5-inch culverin cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.19,0:17:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The pawn shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I was so close, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your reasons are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't let anyone beat me\Nwhen it comes to my Automail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aww! And here, all I wanted to do was show Dominic-san how amazing his Automail is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was plenty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:30.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, \Nyou stupid little girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:30.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need you\Nto do that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, your Automail isn't just some device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're your very limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they're yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember raising any daughters who weren't aware of such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:19:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You make your Automail with the person in mind.\NIt becomes a part of that\Nperson's body, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:06.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.53,0:19:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I was glad when I was able to\Nstand on my own two feet once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you can, locate the criminal who \Ndid that to Brigadier General Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:30.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The investigation concerning his death in the line of duty\Nhas already been suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why I'm asking you, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Working hard as usual, eh, Mustang-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:47.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been too long, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard the rumors that you were being relocated to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't necessarily mean it won't be overruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I could ask for your support, I will serve you to my fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I humbly look forward\Nto your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the right attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm heading upward.\NWill you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to ask,\Nafter all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, if you'll excuse us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.15,0:20:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Winry our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, I noticed earlier that it looks like you've gotten surprisingly taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:53.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Course I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means that before long, I'll need to get a new arm and leg ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it? Why don't\Nwe go back to Resembool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm okay for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it that you simply\Ndon't want Automail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll study harder and harder,\Nto keep you from being handicapped for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,\Nwe want to get our bodies back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something we have\Nto do for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.03,0:21:55.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 27: "Sensei"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive us, Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:50.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for what we did to our mother.
